      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING WICHITA (1) was in the money again last start when second at Gawler (31.10). Should be in the action early from the inside draw. Can make amends this time. VICTA WALLY (2) failed to feature last start after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won by a neck at this track (17.07) beating Whiskey Go Go in a Grade 6 on September 11. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and two minor placings from eight starts. Has ability and can atone. PRIME VOLTAGE (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (31.18) in a Grade 4/5 at Angle Park. Form here sound including two wins. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Worth another chance. BINNAWAY WARRIOR (8) can fill a top-three spot.",
